{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "的野とずっとお話してたよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日、香川と徳島に行ってきました！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob4YWRfc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その時に的野とカメラが回ってない時もずっとお話してました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "終始めっちゃ息ぴったりで、意外と相性がいいんです♪"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と、勝手に私は思っております、、🫣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "シンクロしてるところが何ヶ所かあるのでぜひ見つけてみてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢マチ★アソビ Vol.30｣のステージもとっても楽しくて、すごくあっという間でした！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとあと！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "的野とどっちの方がごはんいっぱい食べられるか競走も実はしてました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も結構食べるよ！いや私も食べますよ！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みたいなやり取りしてたので勝負してたのですが、多分引き分けでしたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "結構手強かったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "負けたくないので胃袋大きくしてまた戦いたいと思います"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobPSChRA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobDoJdRX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobhcatrJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob7o95Q1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobYqfnBw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobqEOHxv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "香川も徳島もとっても人が温かくて、すごく素敵な所なんだなっていうのが伝わってきて心が温かくなりました♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年は香川にツアーで行けるのが楽しみなのと、いつかプライベートで四国に旅行したいなって思いました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ見てね〜！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobdsMu3l.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/irlxdNA-gxs?si=MVIvj0nMQXH8sOIq"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また的野となんか二人でお仕事できたら嬉しいな〜♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "‪𓂃 𓈒𓏸◌‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6/14 オンラインミーグリ🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobUuhr6Q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobZoDRju.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobVMNgXX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は体調優れなくて、声も出しづらくて申し訳なかったです😖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう今は元気です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今週のオンラインもリアミも楽しみです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色々お話しようね🌼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログお読みいただきありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね🌺🌴"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "里奈"}], "source": "official"}